<title>USA: DSG International Q1 shr higher.</title>
<headline>DSG International Q1 shr higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			  1,453		    1,118</p>
<p> Net sales		 56,768		   62,109</p>
<p> Avg			  6,675		    7,850</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is DSG International Ltd, based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 includes an exchange loss of $644,000 or $0.10 a share, primarily due to the unfavorable currency movement in translation of the intercompany loan denominated in Swiss Franc.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 also included income of $501,000 from interest inceom and a one-time settlement by a former tenant of the company's Australian operation.</p>
</text>
